                "text": "I support CA's new school start times. Sleep is vital to students\u2019 physical & mental health & academic performance.\n\nI reintro'd the ZZZ\u2019s to A\u2019s Act so that schools across the country have the tools they need to make informed decisions about start times.\n\nhttps://t.co/i5bdf1zbgq",
