                "text": "Early school start times often don\u2019t allow teens to get the sleep they need to stay healthy & succeed.\n\nMy family experienced this firsthand. I reintro\u2019d my ZZZ\u2019s to A\u2019s Act, which examines school start times & builds on state-based efforts federally.\n\nhttps://t.co/qYwHPiU3yG https://t.co/uyoiEGIeRr",
